      "text": "- No AI attribution by default: no attribution trailer, co-author line, or footer on commits, PRs, or comments, and harness-injected forms (`Claude-Session:`, a session URL, \"Generated with Claude Code\") stay out everywhere. The profile says which `gh` account a checkout uses and what a repository you do not maintain requires before a PR; `gh` holds two accounts and the active one is global state, so check `gh auth status` before any `gh` write.\n"
